Z||000000||8Ball||12-22-2001||07:52 PM||||Ok as some of you may know I am a PC Tech, <BR>And I do ALOT of traveling. Well I needed a dependable car so I bought this today,<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ga2.JPG"> <BR>The Interior is like new And the engine has plenty of go.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Grandam.JPG"> <P>Well I am selling my Fiero so I will only have one payment to make  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Going to sell it for $1000 if anyone wants to fix it. I have to get enuf for it to pay off the loan I took for it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>When times are better I will be getting another Fiero.<P>Hopefully soon. Til then it is still a pontiac and nice at that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>E.B.||||reg||1
