Z||000002||8Ball||12-22-2001||08:19 PM||||Well it has an oil leak, And recently (wensday) It quit starting. I am pretty sure now it is the coil or the starter.<BR>I replaced the module today. I went to a car lot I was told about to buy a Fiero for 100 dollars. Supposed to run good be a v6 like mine but need a tranny. I was going to get it for parts. Turned out it was an 84 $400 and everything was in horrid shape. The frame was rusted thru in many many places. So I decided to buy a nice dependable car. I still love my Fiero and all Fiero's but just cannot afford it atm.<P>When the bills are reduced I will get another one  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
